			"notes": "- The vanilla recipe book now shows recipe previews when ingredients are unavailable in your inventory and nearby storage.\n- Fixed stale nearby ingredient availability after switching worlds.\n- Fixed a renderer compatibility crash and restored nearby-container highlighting on Minecraft 1.21.4.\n\nUpdate both client and server to 1.1.3 for the recipe-preview fix.\n\nRequires Architectury API. Fabric also requires Fabric API."
